Error [E0225]: The move marker `^` cannot take a field out of a collection element
  --> move_mark_element_field.jet:14:13
    |
 14 |     tags := ^items[0].tags
    |             ^
 Why: An element stays owned by its collection together with every field inside it, so this value can only be a copy
 Fix: Write the copy marker `~` instead of `^` to copy the field
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0225

